pyitm 0.3
=========

The pyitm compatibility module (src/pyitm.rs) reproduces the behaviour of
pyitm 0.3 (https://github.com/tmd224/pyitm), a Python translation of ITM
1.2.2, including its departures from ITM, so that programs moving off pyitm
get the same results. It follows pyitm's itm.area() and the functions it
calls, translated to Rust. pyitm is distributed under this licence:

